(7239425, 1120996, 52928, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at motion capture but still too out of focus to merit a high mark.</td>', 'Good attempt at motion capture but still too out of focus to merit a high mark.', '2014-07-10 05:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7239426, 1121514, 52928, '<td valign="top">Sharp capture; great detail; interesting subject. I also like the use of negative space on the right side.  If I had to criticise I would have liked the text to be the other way up, but if this is how it''s stamped on the watch then there wasn''t really anything you could do about that.  My favourite.</td>', 'Sharp capture; great detail; interesting subject. I also like the use of negative space on the right side.  If I had to criticise I would have liked the text to be the other way up, but if this is how it''s stamped on the watch then there wasn''t really anything you could do about that.  My favourite.', '2014-07-10 05:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7239427, 1121725, 52928, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. Full of dynamism from the lean of the bikes through the static landscape around. Rider''s colours work well against the blue sky.</td>', 'Lovely image. Full of dynamism from the lean of the bikes through the static landscape around. Rider''s colours work well against the blue sky.', '2014-07-10 05:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7239428, 1122031, 52928, '<td valign="top">Very emotive capture.  Wonder if it might have been enhanced taking a little later with more light in the upper sky</td>', 'Very emotive capture.  Wonder if it might have been enhanced taking a little later with more light in the upper sky', '2014-07-10 05:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7239430, 1122124, 52928, '<td valign="top">A good sharp capture - makes me think of a car magazine.</td>', 'A good sharp capture - makes me think of a car magazine.', '2014-07-10 05:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7239432, 1122064, 52928, '<td valign="top">Like that you''ve captured other vehicles in the hub caps.  Well spotted.</td>', 'Like that you''ve captured other vehicles in the hub caps.  Well spotted.', '2014-07-10 05:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7239433, 1121356, 52928, '<td valign="top">Would like to have seen the bike as a larger element in the photo.</td>', 'Would like to have seen the bike as a larger element in the photo.', '2014-07-10 05:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7239434, 1121938, 52928, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit out of focus and overly grainy</td>', 'Looks a bit out of focus and overly grainy', '2014-07-10 05:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7239435, 1121933, 52928, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about this one. The wheel seems almost inconsequential to the image itself.  I wonder if you''d used a shorter exposure time to get more detail of the wheel and had it fill more of the frame might have improved this.</td>', 'I''m not sure about this one. The wheel seems almost inconsequential to the image itself.  I wonder if you''d used a shorter exposure time to get more detail of the wheel and had it fill more of the frame might have improved this.', '2014-07-10 05:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
