(7239649, 1121756, 168591, '<td valign="top">The right side is overexposed and the left is underexposed, you should work in blanking the light and also you should use a tripod to get a sharper image. If there is a lot of light, use a white blanket to soft the image. 4</td>', 'The right side is overexposed and the left is underexposed, you should work in blanking the light and also you should use a tripod to get a sharper image. If there is a lot of light, use a white blanket to soft the image. 4', '2014-07-10 18:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
