(7242264, 1122170, 97225, '<td valign="top">Ahh! Bummer about the DQ. You had me fooled. I actually thought you''d had a craniotomy to show us your inner workings.</td>', 'Ahh! Bummer about the DQ. You had me fooled. I actually thought you''d had a craniotomy to show us your inner workings.', '2014-07-18 21:48:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7242272, 1122170, 123833, '<td valign="top">That''s a bummer! And I don''t agree with DQ at all! Without your head it would be a very boring picture with no meaning! :) Why not call it head-wear? There are all sorts of things printed on baseball hats and they would not be DQ''d!</td>', 'That''s a bummer! And I don''t agree with DQ at all! Without your head it would be a very boring picture with no meaning! :) Why not call it head-wear? There are all sorts of things printed on baseball hats and they would not be DQ''d!', '2014-07-18 22:33:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7242295, 1122170, 117534, '<td valign="top">Really I don''t agree with the DQ, but then my last DQ was a camera date error where it showed the pix taken two days after the start of the challenge.... I really think they should give leeway for dumb-assness... <br/> <br/>I think your cogs need greased! LOL Good edit totally blew me away wondering how you did it in advanced!</td>', 'Really I don''t agree with the DQ, but then my last DQ was a camera date error where it showed the pix taken two days after the start of the challenge.... I really think they should give leeway for dumb-assness...  I think your cogs need greased! LOL Good edit totally blew me away wondering how you did it in advanced!', '2014-07-18 23:52:44.000000', NULL, 0),
