(7243330, 1122170, 121949, '<td valign="top">I don''t check in here often anymore, but the thread caught my eye. I haven''t read through it but in my own humble opinion this should not have been DQ''ed. Great idea! I would have done it myself and been very surprised at a DQ.</td>', 'I don''t check in here often anymore, but the thread caught my eye. I haven''t read through it but in my own humble opinion this should not have been DQ''ed. Great idea! I would have done it myself and been very surprised at a DQ.', '2014-07-22 22:23:42.000000', NULL, 0),
